To add an automated screenshot capability to your reporting engine, you can capture a visual snapshot of the page tree at the exact millisecond an anomaly or a payload reflection occurs.
Because standard XSS payloads trigger an alert() dialog box that pauses JavaScript rendering natively, Puppeteer can capture a crisp image of the DOM state right after the dialog is closed, or capture the exact HTML reflection area visually.
